# Allowlist: the top-level (docs) image is built with the repo root as context, and
# the root holds ~36 GB that this Dockerfile never reads (rust/ build output, venv/,
# cpp/build*/, the subprojects' own trees). Exclude everything, then re-include
# exactly the files the Dockerfile COPYs -- keep this list in step with its COPY lines.
# The cpp/, python/ and rust/ images use their own directories as context and their
# own .dockerignore files.
*
!entrypoint/01-install-base.sh
!entrypoint/02-install-docs.sh
!entrypoint/.bashrc
!entrypoint/entrypoint.sh
!entrypoint/format.sh
!entrypoint/type-check.sh
!python/requirements.txt
